<title>USA: G&amp;K acquires Allied Cleanroom.</title>
<headline>G&amp;K acquires Allied Cleanroom.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>G&amp;K Services Inc said Monday it acquired Allied Cleanroom Technologies Inc, a processor of specialized cleanroom garments used mainly in the electronics and semiconductor industries.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Allied has annual revenues of about $4 million, G&amp;K said.</p>
<p>G&amp;K supplies uniforms to businesses.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
